Trademark / product clarity
---------------------------
Open-Meowdoku and Guessingame are not affiliated with Oakever Games or the
commercial mobile app often marketed as "Meowdoku". This repo is an open
documentation + traffic hub for the free browser version hosted on Guessingame.
